  m_text: "  Use the WASD / Directional Keys to move, the mouse to aim & left mouse
    button to fire\n\n  Using your Personal Data Assistant (TAB) lets you view your
    curent arsenal and map\n\n  Some objects such as chests and doors can be interacted
    with by pressing the E key. \n  Use the environment to your advantage!\n  \n 
    Use the middle mouse wheel or the number keys (1-9) to cycle through your weapon
    slots\n\n  Health and ammo can be replenished by destroying enemies or opening
    chests. Don't die!\n\n  Press 'ESC' to pause the game and access the menu at
    any time\n\n  Make your way through the game by defeating all adversaries. \n 
    When every room has been cleared out, there may be a boss to fight and defeat!\n\n 
    Good luck soldier, and kick some butt! "
